#: docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:58
msgid ""
"One build directory admits one resolved assembly. Use separate build "
"directories for different boards or CPU/security images; a product build "
"coordinator or CI matrix owns their orchestration. Runtime and Platform "
"reuse the same production mechanisms but are separate consumption modes."
msgstr ""
"一个构建目录只接纳一份解析后的装配。不同板卡或 CPU／安全域镜像使用独立构建目录，由产品构建协调器或 CI 矩阵编排。Runtime 与 "
"Platform 复用相同生产机制，但属于不同的消费模式。"

#: docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:63
msgid ""
"The common OS boundary is the wait/wake port. Task, queue, join and storage "
"APIs remain backend-specific, including the real kernel control-block types."
" Products switching kernels must adapt that lifecycle explicitly; no "
"universal object pool or hidden scheduling task is supplied."
msgstr ""
"共同 OS 边界是等待／唤醒端口。任务、队列、join 和存储 API "
"仍为后端专用，包括真实内核控制块类型。产品切换内核时必须显式适配生命周期；平台不提供统一对象池或隐藏调度任务。"

msgid "Build-time decisions and runtime work"
msgstr "构建期决策与运行时工作"

msgid ""
"TOML schema 2 is the only authored platform input. The parser freezes "
"user intent as `AuthoredAssembly`; `resolve_ir()` combines it with "
"reviewed SoC/Board facts and validates modes, resources, clocks, IRQs, "
"ABI, DMA reachability and budgets. It returns `ConfigurationIR` "
"directly. Named frozen records hold each decision once; they do not "
"expose a Mapping facade or a duplicate `values` store. Hardware fact "
"leaves and keyed indexes still use immutable mappings, and local "
"resolver validation drafts may use dictionaries. These are explicit data"
" boundaries, not a promise to assign a separate nominal type to every "
"JSON field."
msgstr ""
"TOML schema 2 是平台唯一的人工编写输入。解析器将用户意图冻结为 `AuthoredAssembly`；`resolve_ir()`"
" 结合经审查的 SoC/Board 事实，校验模式、资源、时钟、IRQ、ABI、DMA 可达性与预算，并直接返回 "
"`ConfigurationIR`。具名冻结记录为每个决策只保存一份值，不暴露 Mapping 包装接口，也不保存重复的 "
"`values`。硬件事实叶数据和按键索引仍使用不可变 mapping，resolver "
"的局部校验草稿也可用字典。这些是明确的数据边界，不承诺为每个 JSON 字段创建独立名义类型。"

msgid ""
"Factory and emitters consume the same typed result. `to_dict()` derives "
"the schema-1 `resolved.json` audit/artifact projection; it is never read"
" back as an authored platform input. Private typed source epoch 2 is "
"separate from that serialized format and from the public C factory "
"epoch. Old JSON assemblies are rejected. Historical evidence keeps its "
"original bytes and read-only verification. CMake owns the source "
"dependency graph; resolution does not discover software from device "
"names or generate product workers."
msgstr ""
"Factory 和 emitter 消费同一类型化结果。`to_dict()` 派生 schema-1 `resolved.json` "
"审计／产物投影，绝不会将其读回为人工编写的平台输入。私有 typed source epoch 2 与该序列化格式、公共 C factory "
"epoch 分别计代。旧 JSON 装配会被拒绝。历史证据保留原字节与只读校验。CMake "
"拥有源码依赖图；解析不会从设备名称发现软件，也不会生成产品 worker。"

msgid ""
"![Actual compile-target dependency relationships](../assets/diagrams/build-"
"targets.svg)"
msgstr "![实际编译目标依赖关系](../assets/diagrams/build-targets.svg)"

msgid "Actual compile-target dependency relationships"
msgstr "实际编译目标依赖关系"

msgid ""
"FIG-02 is the checked compile graph. Vendor and provider includes remain "
"private; public consumers receive Nexus types and selected compile/link "
"policy."
msgstr "FIG-02 是已核对的编译图。厂商和提供者包含路径保持私有；公共消费工程获得 Nexus 类型及所选编译／链接策略。"

msgid ""
"![Authored inputs, atomic generation and firmware "
"artifacts](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"
msgstr "![编写的输入、原子生成与固件产物](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"

msgid "Authored inputs, atomic generation and firmware artifacts"
msgstr "编写的输入、原子生成与固件产物"

msgid ""
"FIG-03 shows current generation. Unknown and conflicting selections fail; no"
" Kconfig/cache/old-header fallback repairs them. Runtime factory lookup "
"returns an existing face. After explicit successful platform start, ordinary"
" operations call its shared ops table with its instance context. IRQ "
"dispatch is fixed to provider instances and does not repeat factory lookup "
"for every byte."
msgstr ""
"FIG-03 表达当前生成流程。未知或冲突选择必须失败；不得通过 "
"Kconfig／缓存／旧头文件回退修补。运行时类型化工厂查找返回已有接口面。平台显式启动成功后，普通操作通过共享 ops 表调用该实例上下文。IRQ "
"分发固定到提供者实例，不为每个字节重复执行工厂查找。"

msgid ""
"The constructor contract names private state, definitions, "
"initialization, stop actions and failed-init responsibility explicitly. "
"Its initializer and stop list use immutable `DirectCall` values with "
"explicit static references or constants; no free-form C expression or "
"function-pointer/member-call expression can enter those fields. "
"Definitions and some remaining cold helper bodies are still emitted as C"
" source. The C compiler establishes actual symbol and parameter types. "
"Model tests and linked-image checks remain necessary: this narrow "
"representation is not a complete typed C AST. Common generation does not"
" infer these decisions from family names. Selected STM32F4 official LL "
"operations remain inside private SoC state machines; factory and public "
"I/O contracts are unchanged. Full HAL Handle/callback transport requires"
" separate mode-specific evaluation. See [official driver "
"integration](../design/official-stm32-provider.md)."
msgstr ""
"构造合同明确命名私有状态、定义、初始化、停止动作和初始化失败责任。initializer 与 stop 列表使用不可变 "
"`DirectCall`，参数为显式静态引用或常量；这些字段不接受任意 C "
"表达式或函数指针／成员调用表达式。定义及部分尚存的冷态辅助函数体仍作为 C 源码生成。C "
"编译器建立实际符号与参数类型。模型测试和链接镜像检查仍不可省略：这种窄表示不是完整的类型化 C AST。公共生成器不从系列名称推断这些决策。选定"
" STM32F4 官方 LL 操作仍在私有 SoC 状态机内部，factory 与公共 I/O 合同不变。完整 HAL "
"Handle/callback "
"传输需要按具体模式单独评估。参见[官方驱动集成](../design/official-stm32-provider.md)。"

msgid ""
"The legacy F103/GD303 selections share private algorithms only after exact "
"vendor register, bit, clock and memory checks. A TX-only channel-DMA "
"instance owns a compact TX prefix and an IRQ-byte ring; only duplex adds the"
" finite RX-block extension. Selected methods and direct IRQ entries let "
"ordinary section GC remove unused block code. No runtime forwarding layer or"
" implicit mode fallback is added."
msgstr ""
"F103/GD303 legacy 选择仅在核对精确厂商寄存器、位、时钟与内存后共享私有算法。TX-only channel-DMA 实例只有紧凑 TX"
" 前缀和 IRQ byte ring；duplex 才增加有限 RX block 扩展。所选方法与直接 IRQ 入口让普通 section GC "
"移除未使用的 block 代码，不增加运行时转发层或隐式模式回退。"

msgid ""
"G474's selected ADC bulb mode, H743's Cache/domain policies and U575's TZEN0"
" peripherals remain exact SoC contracts. Optional H743 D2 SRAM1 is budgeted "
"and initialized before DMA admission; hardware reachability alone does not "
"authorize an arbitrary address. Finite RX/ADC blocks require explicit owner "
"service and rearm gaps. The separate TZEN1 GPIO job copies at most eight "
"commands into Secure storage and retains no NonSecure pointer. It is not "
"general asynchronous I/O."
msgstr ""
"G474 所选 ADC bulb 模式、H743 Cache/domain 政策与 U575 TZEN0 外设均遵守精确 SoC 合同。可选 H743 "
"D2 SRAM1 在 DMA 准入前显式预算并初始化；硬件可达性本身不授权任意地址。有限 RX/ADC block 需要显式 owner "
"service，具有 rearm 间隙。独立 TZEN1 GPIO job 把最多八条命令复制到 Secure 存储，返回后不保留 NonSecure "
"指针，不构成通用异步 I/O。"

msgid "Lifecycle and failure responsibility"
msgstr "生命周期与失败责任"

msgid ""
"![Current initialization, failure withdrawal and retained cleanup "
"responsibility](../assets/diagrams/platform-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![当前初始化、失败撤回与保留的清理责任](../assets/diagrams/platform-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid ""
"Current initialization, failure withdrawal and retained cleanup "
"responsibility"
msgstr "当前初始化、失败撤回与保留的清理责任"

msgid ""
"FIG-05 shows explicit startup and reverse cleanup. A static face can exist "
"before start and after stop; its pointer is not a capability to execute cold"
" hardware. Partial failure can retain irreversible watchdog effects or busy "
"borrows. Products must inspect primary and cleanup outcomes, continue the "
"real executor, and retain quarantined resources. Platform start never starts"
" a scheduler."
msgstr ""
"FIG-05 表达显式启动与逆序清理。静态接口面可以在启动前和停止后存在；其指针不授予操作未启动硬件的权限。部分失败可能留下不可逆 watchdog "
"效果或活跃借用。产品必须检查主要结果与清理结果，继续运行真实执行器，并保留隔离资源。平台启动从不启动调度器。"

msgid ""
"Physical Flash reports exact geometry and `program_flags`. An ECC fresh-"
"erase requirement belongs to the caller's provenance contract: all-FF "
"readback cannot prove unused ECC state, and a failed pulse requires another "
"erase. All-FF source units issue no pulse. A started pulse must settle "
"before return; an expired deadline prevents later pulses and never cancels "
"hardware already programming. Products own writable regions, voltage, "
"execution stalls, watchdog and power loss."
msgstr ""
"物理 Flash 报告精确 geometry 和 `program_flags`。ECC fresh-erase 是调用方的真实历史合同：全 FF "
"读回不能证明 ECC 未被编程，失败脉冲后必须重新擦除。全 FF 输入单元不产生脉冲。已启动的脉冲必须先排空才能返回；过期 deadline "
"只能阻止后续脉冲，不能取消正在编程的硬件。产品负责可写 region、电压、执行停顿、watchdog 与掉电策略。"

msgid ""
"Optional generated diagnosed start/stop entries write phase and controller "
"location to caller-owned cold-path storage. They retain no diagnostic "
"pointer and do not replace the primary/cleanup results or remaining-effect "
"obligations. See [the diagnostic contract](../design/official-"
"stm32-provider.md) for index meaning and failure responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"生成的可选 diagnosed start/stop "
"入口将阶段和控制器位置写入调用方拥有的冷路径存储，不保留诊断指针，也不替代主要结果、清理结果或剩余效果责任。索引含义与失败责任见[诊断合同](../design/official-"
"stm32-provider.md)。"

msgid "Costs and tradeoffs"
msgstr "成本与取舍"

msgid ""
"A 32-bit face contains two pointers: eight bytes of readonly storage. "
"Provider/mode ops are shared; exact mutable state and selected buffers "
"remain separate. Indirection lets one public interface serve independent "
"concrete providers and GoogleMock ports. Its cost is one public dispatch and"
" code/readonly table retention; actual Flash/RAM and timing are measured on "
"the selected linked image."
msgstr ""
"32 位接口面包含两个指针，占用八字节只读存储。提供者／模式的 ops 共享；精确可变状态与所选缓冲区分开。间接调用允许同一公共接口服务独立具体提供者与"
" GoogleMock 端口。成本是一次公共分发以及保留代码／只读表；实际 Flash／RAM 与时序必须在所选链接镜像上测量。"

msgid ""
"Static assembly rejects conflicts early and prunes unselected drivers. It "
"deliberately forgoes hotplug discovery, runtime string registries, arbitrary"
" dynamic clock changes and automatic recovery policy. Optional shared owners"
" add explicitly budgeted slots and synchronization; direct single-executor "
"paths need no default OS lock or worker."
msgstr ""
"静态装配提前拒绝冲突，裁剪未选择驱动。它不提供热插拔发现、运行时字符串注册表、任意动态时钟变化或自动恢复策略。可选共享 owner "
"增加显式预算的槽与同步；直接单执行器路径不需要默认 OS 锁或执行任务。"

msgid ""
"Read [factory](factory.md), [ownership](ownership.md), the [integration "
"contract](../design/integration-contracts.md) and [exact "
"support](../reference/platforms/support.md). Architecture diagrams explain "
"mechanisms; tests, image checks and HIL establish their separate execution "
"scopes."
msgstr ""
"阅读[类型化工厂](factory.md)、[所有权](ownership.md)、[接入合同](../design/integration-"
"contracts.md)和[精确支持范围](../reference/platforms/support.md)。架构图解释机制；测试、镜像检查和 "
"HIL 分别建立各自执行范围。"
